<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The large roof illumination light has been discontinued. Accordingly, the front personal lights and room light have been changed.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The shift light has been discontinued.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The glove box light has been discontinued.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The engine switch illumination position has been changed.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
